dict(slug="chef-privado-o-catering", cat="experiencias", fecha="2026-10-09",
 img="photo-1555244162-803834f70033", foto="Saile Ilyas",
 es=dict(
  titulo="Chef privado o catering: cuál conviene para tu evento",
  bajada="Las dos opciones resuelven la comida, pero no son lo mismo. Diferencias en experiencia, cantidad de invitados y presupuesto.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","Cuando organizás un cumpleaños, una cena con clientes o una celebración en casa, aparecen dos caminos: contratar un catering o traer un chef privado. Los dos te sacan la cocina de encima, pero la experiencia que viven tus invitados es muy distinta."),
   ("h2","La diferencia en una línea"),
   ("p","<b>El catering entrega la comida lista para servir; el chef privado termina cada plato en tu casa.</b> Con catering recibís bandejas. Con un chef, la preproducción se hace en su cocina y cada paso se regenera, se termina y se emplata en el momento, frente a tus invitados."),
   ("tabla",["","Chef privado","Catering"],[
     ["Dónde se cocina","Preproducido en su cocina y terminado en la tuya","Todo en su cocina, antes del evento"],
     ["Formato","Menú de pasos servido a la mesa","Bandejas, buffet o finger food"],
     ["Grupo ideal","2 a 12 personas (más, a medida)","Grupos grandes"],
     ["Personalización","Total: menú a medida","Sobre una carta fija"],
     ["Experiencia","Cena de restaurante en casa","Comida resuelta"]]),
   ("h2","Cuándo conviene un chef privado"),
   ("ul",["Cenas íntimas, aniversarios o cumpleaños de pocos invitados.",
          "Cenas con clientes donde la experiencia también comunica.",
          "Cuando querés un menú de pasos y no una mesa de bandejas.",
          "Si hay restricciones alimentarias que necesitan cuidado especial."]),
   ("h2","Cuándo conviene un catering"),
   ("ul",["Eventos grandes donde la gente circula y come de pie.",
          "Cuando no hay cocina disponible en el lugar.",
          "Si el foco está en la cantidad más que en la experiencia gastronómica."]),
   ("tip","Hay un punto medio: para grupos de más de 12 personas podés armar un evento a medida con chef y staff de servicio, con estaciones o finger food cocinados en el lugar. Es catering con sabor de restaurante."),
   ("p","Si tu evento es para un grupo chico, mirá la <a href=\"/menu-degustacion-7-pasos\">degustación de 7 pasos</a>. Si es más grande o corporativo, contame la idea en <a href=\"/eventos-corporativos\">eventos y empresas</a>."),
  ]),
 en=dict(
  titulo="Private chef or catering: which one fits your event",
  bajada="Both take care of the food, but they are not the same. Differences in experience, guest count and budget.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","When you plan a birthday, a client dinner or a celebration at home, two paths appear: hire a caterer or bring in a private chef. Both take the kitchen off your hands, but your guests' experience is very different."),
   ("h2","The difference in one line"),
   ("p","<b>Catering delivers food ready to serve; a private chef finishes each dish at your home.</b> With catering you get trays. With a chef, the prep is done in their kitchen and each course is reheated, finished and plated on the spot, in front of your guests."),
   ("tabla",["","Private chef","Catering"],[["Where it's cooked","Prepped in their kitchen, finished in yours","All in their kitchen, beforehand"],["Format","Plated courses at the table","Trays, buffet or finger food"],["Ideal group","2 to 12 guests (more, custom)","Large groups"],["Customization","Full: tailor-made menu","From a set menu"],["Experience","Restaurant dinner at home","Food taken care of"]]),
   ("h2","When a private chef makes sense"),
   ("ul",["Intimate dinners, anniversaries or small birthdays.","Client dinners where the experience also sends a message.","When you want a coursed menu, not a table of trays.","If there are dietary restrictions that need special care."]),
   ("h2","When catering makes sense"),
   ("ul",["Large events where people mingle and eat standing.","When there is no kitchen at the venue.","If the focus is on quantity more than on the dining experience."]),
   ("tip","There's a middle ground: for groups over 12 you can plan a custom event with a chef and service staff, with stations or finger food cooked on site. Catering with a restaurant taste."),
   ("p","For a small group, see the <a href=\"/menu-degustacion-7-pasos\">7-course tasting</a>. For something bigger or corporate, tell me the idea in <a href=\"/eventos-corporativos\">events & companies</a>."),
  ])),
