dict(slug="como-funciona-un-chef-semanal", cat="experiencias", fecha="2026-10-09",
 img="photo-1543353071-873f17a7a088", foto="Ella Olsson",
 es=dict(
  titulo="Cómo funciona un chef semanal (y si te conviene)",
  bajada="Una o dos jornadas de cocina en tu casa y la semana resuelta. Qué incluye, cuántas horas lleva y cuánto cuesta.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","El chef semanal es para quien quiere comer casero y rico toda la semana sin pasarse las noches cocinando. La idea es simple: <b>un chef cocina en tu casa uno o dos días y te deja las comidas listas, fraccionadas y etiquetadas</b>."),
   ("h2","Cómo es una semana"),
   ("ol",["Armamos el menú por WhatsApp con tus gustos, rutinas y restricciones.",
          "El día acordado cocino en tu casa, con tu cocina y tus utensilios.",
          "Dejo todo fraccionado y etiquetado, con indicaciones de qué va a la heladera y qué conviene congelar.",
          "Durante la semana solo calentás y servís."]),
   ("h2","2 o 5 comidas por día"),
   ("tabla",["Opción","Qué incluye","Jornada"],[
     ["2 comidas por día","Almuerzo y cena","~8 horas"],
     ["5 comidas por día","Desayuno, almuerzo, merienda, cena y postre","~12 horas"]]),
   ("p","Con una jornada cubrís media semana; con dos, la semana completa. Para 1 a 2 personas, una jornada de 2 comidas por día arranca en $160.000 (honorario del servicio; los ingredientes se coordinan aparte). Podés ver todos los valores en <a href=\"/chef-semanal\">chef semanal</a>."),
   ("tip","Pedí que al menos una preparación por jornada sea \"base\": un guiso, una salsa o legumbres que rindan para combinar con distintas guarniciones. Es el truco para que la semana no se sienta repetida."),
   ("h2","¿Para quién es?"),
   ("ul",["Familias con poco tiempo entre semana.",
          "Personas que quieren comer mejor y dejar el delivery.",
          "Quien sigue una alimentación específica y necesita orden.",
          "Parejas que prefieren invertir el tiempo en otra cosa."]),
   ("dato","La cocina hogareña alcanza: hornallas, horno, heladera con espacio y recipientes. Si faltan recipientes, lo coordinamos antes."),
  ]),
 en=dict(
  titulo="How a weekly chef works (and whether it suits you)",
  bajada="One or two cooking sessions at your home and the week sorted. What it includes, how many hours it takes and what it costs.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","A weekly chef is for people who want to eat tasty home food all week without spending their evenings cooking. The idea is simple: <b>a chef cooks at your home one or two days and leaves your meals ready, portioned and labeled</b>."),
   ("h2","What a week looks like"),
   ("ol",["We plan the menu on WhatsApp around your tastes, routines and dietary needs.","On the agreed day I cook at your home, with your kitchen and utensils.","I leave everything portioned and labeled, noting what goes in the fridge and what is best frozen.","During the week you just heat and serve."]),
   ("h2","2 or 5 meals a day"),
   ("tabla",["Option","What it includes","Session"],[["2 meals a day","Lunch and dinner","~8 hours"],["5 meals a day","Breakfast, lunch, afternoon snack, dinner and dessert","~12 hours"]]),
   ("p","One session covers half the week; two cover the full week. For 1 to 2 people, a session with 2 meals a day starts at $160,000 (service fee; ingredients are coordinated separately). See all prices at <a href=\"/chef-semanal\">weekly chef</a>."),
   ("tip","Ask for at least one \"base\" dish per session: a stew, a sauce or legumes that stretch across different sides. It is the trick to keep the week from feeling repetitive."),
   ("h2","Who is it for?"),
   ("ul",["Families with little time during the week.","People who want to eat better and drop delivery.","Anyone on a specific diet who needs structure.","Couples who'd rather spend their time on something else."]),
   ("dato","A regular home kitchen is enough: burners, an oven, a fridge with space and containers. If containers are missing, we sort it out beforehand."),
  ])),
